  "notes": "Boot a Black Rose ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released) and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled; the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM loop with Escape and open the service menu. Start T.5 FLASHER TEST and step it with Up until it wraps, taking three frames 0.35 s apart at every step because the selected name blinks. In repeat mode the ROM pulses the selected flasher and prints its own name and wire colours, pairing each name with the public address PinMAME published. T.5 must pulse 17 after it starts.",
